FINTRACK — UPDATED HOSTINGER BUSINESS PACKAGE

1) Read HOSTINGER_DEPLOY_GUIDE.md before uploading.
2) Upload this ZIP using Hostinger's Node.js Web App flow, not as a static/PHP site.
3) The application uses PostgreSQL; configure an external PostgreSQL DATABASE_URL.
4) Hostinger must run: npm run build && npm run db:push (first deployment).
5) The old dist/ folder was deliberately excluded because it contained the previous build.
6) IMPORTANT: the guide documents authentication security issues found in the supplied source. Do not use real financial data or expose the app publicly until those are fixed.

This archive is source-based: it requires Hostinger's build process to produce dist/index.cjs and dist/public/.
